			"notes": "# Version 2.0.0\n\n# 📄 Changes\n- Fixed bug where the forge server crashes if stopped immediately after starting.\n- Config file is now generated in the folder \"config\" called \"sleepingserverstoppermod-common.toml\".\n- Config file has two values:\n  - SHUTDOWN_TIME_IN_MINUTES - How many minutes until the server closes. (Minimum is 1 minute!). \n  - SHUTDOWN_SERVER_ON_LAUNCH - Should the server shutdown on launch?\n- Default values are (2, true)."
		},
